### Catalog Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/health

###

### Catalog - Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/all

###

### Catalog - Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/1

###

### Catalog - Get Products by Category
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products?category_id=1

###

### Catalog - Create Product
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeProfileId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "product_name": "Test Product",
  "description": "Test Description",
  "brand": "TestBrand",
  "price": 99.99,
  "discountPrice": 79.99,
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "sku": "TEST-001",
  "isActive": true,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "weight": 1.5,
  "dimensions": "10x10x10"
}

